<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Affiliate Dashboard - AlMasterclass</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .nav {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            padding: 15px 30px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .nav-brand {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #764ba2;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: #333;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            background: #f0f0f0;
        }

        .btn-logout {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: #dc3545;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .header {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .header h1 {
            color: #764ba2;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #764ba2;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .stat-label {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .card h2 {
            color: #764ba2;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        th {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #333;
        }

        td {
            padding: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .badge-free {
            background: #6c757d;
            color: white;
        }

        .badge-upgraded {
            background: #28a745;
            color: white;
        }

        .badge-churned {
            background: #dc3545;
            color: white;
        }

        .empty-state {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
            color: #666;
        }

        .empty-state-icon {
            font-size: 4em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <nav class="nav">
            <div class="nav-brand">AlMasterclass</div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/dashboard" class="nav-link">Dashboard</a>
                <a href="/courses" class="nav-link">Courses</a>
                <a href="/community" class="nav-link">Community</a>
                <a href="/affiliate" class="nav-link">Affiliate</a>
                <form action="/api/auth/logout" method="POST" style="display: inline;">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-logout">Logout</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <div class="header">
            <h1>💰 Affiliate Dashboard</h1>
            <p>Track your referrals and earnings in real-time</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number"><%= affiliateStats.total_referrals || 0 %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Total Referrals</div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number"><%= affiliateStats.active_referrals || 0 %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Active Subscribers</div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">$<%= (affiliateStats.total_commissions_earned || 0).toFixed(2) %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Total Earned</div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">$<%= (affiliateStats.pending_commissions || 0).toFixed(2) %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Pending Payout</div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-card">
                <div class="stat-number">$<%= (affiliateStats.paid_commissions || 0).toFixed(2) %></div>
                <div class="stat-label">Paid Out</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Your Referrals</h2>

            <% if (referrals && referrals.length > 0) { %>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Name</th>
                        <th>Email</th>
                        <th>Joined</th>
                        <th>Status</th>
                        <th>Upgraded On</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <% referrals.forEach(referral => { %>
                    <tr>
                        <td><%= referral.full_name %></td>
                        <td><%= referral.email %></td>
                        <td><%= new Date(referral.signup_date).toLocaleDateString() %></td>
                        <td>
                            <span class="badge badge-<%= referral.status %>">
                                <%= referral.status === 'free' ? 'Free' : referral.status === 'upgraded' ? 'Premium' : 'Churned' %>
                            </span>
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            <%= referral.upgraded_at ? new Date(referral.upgraded_at).toLocaleDateString() : '-' %>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <% }); %>
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <% } else { %>
            <div class="empty-state">
                <div class="empty-state-icon">🎯</div>
                <h3>No referrals yet</h3>
                <p>Share your affiliate link to start earning commissions!</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-family: monospace; background: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;">
                    <%= affiliateLink %>
                </p>
            </div>
            <% } %>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>💡 Maximize Your Earnings</h2>
            <ul style="line-height: 2.5; color: #666;">
                <li><strong>Share on social media:</strong> Post your link on Facebook, Twitter, Instagram</li>
                <li><strong>Email your network:</strong> Send personalized emails to friends and colleagues</li>
                <li><strong>Create content:</strong> Write blog posts or make videos about your experience</li>
                <li><strong>Join communities:</strong> Share in Muslim entrepreneur groups (respectfully)</li>
                <li><strong>Be authentic:</strong> Share your genuine journey and results</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Commission Structure</h2>
            <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
                You earn <strong>30% recurring commission</strong> on all payments from your referrals.<br>
                <strong>Monthly Plan:</strong> $47/month → You earn $14.10/month per referral<br>
                <strong>Yearly Plan:</strong> $470/year → You earn $141/year per referral<br><br>
                Commissions are paid automatically when you reach $50 minimum payout.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
